main.content:
A template that redirects to the Turtle WoW database. To be used under the External links header at the bottom of a page.

Based on the article type, use the word type ('''quest''', '''npc''', '''item''', '''object''', '''spell''', '''faction''') as the first parameter and the respective ID as the second parameter.

Example codes:
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|quest|8}}</nowiki>
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|npc|6784}}</nowiki>
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|item|4604}}</nowiki>
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|object|148504}}</nowiki>
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|spell|100}}</nowiki>
*<nowiki>{{Elinks|faction|81}}</nowiki>

Generates:
{{Elinks|quest|8}}
{{Elinks|npc|6784}}
{{Elinks|item|4604}}
{{Elinks|object|148504}}
{{Elinks|spell|100}}
{{Elinks|faction|81}}

